WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:01.040
Well, this is interesting.

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:03.300
When the Bidens moved
into the White House,

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:06.673
they brought their two dogs
with them, Champ and Major.

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:10.310
There they are, beautiful
German shepherds.

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:11.620
Well, here's the thing.

00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:13.520
When there are dogs in the White House,

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:17.290
the Secret Service has a
special canine security detail.

00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:19.860
It protects the dogs, yeah.

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:22.380
I'm curious what it's like
protecting the President's dog,

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:23.870
so I wanted to find out.

00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:28.830
Joining me now, canine
Special Agent James Duncan.

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:30.820
Hello, Agent Duncan.

00:00:30.820 --> 00:00:32.290
Hello, Mr. O'Brien.

00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:33.560
Now let me get this straight, sir.

00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:35.600
You're the Secret Service agent assigned

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:38.200
to protect Champ and
Major, is that correct?

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:39.033
Yes, sir.

00:00:39.033 --> 00:00:41.020
That's correct, and as a
matter of fact, I've got,

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:42.670
I've got Champ and Major right here

00:00:42.670 --> 00:00:44.020
at my feet as we speak, sir.

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:44.853
Oh, great.

00:00:44.853 --> 00:00:45.879
This is cool.

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:46.712
Can we see them?

00:00:46.712 --> 00:00:47.545
Is it, is that possible?

00:00:47.545 --> 00:00:48.410
No, I'm afraid not.

00:00:48.410 --> 00:00:50.280
You know, it is a security thing,

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:55.280
and also I am, I'm not
allowed to tip the, the camera

00:00:55.290 --> 00:00:57.450
down towards my lap anymore on Zoom calls.

00:00:57.450 --> 00:00:58.283
Right, right.

00:00:58.283 --> 00:00:59.320
That's been, people have been getting

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:00.630
in trouble for that, yeah.

00:01:00.630 --> 00:01:01.720
So let's get to the point.

00:01:01.720 --> 00:01:04.220
If you're a canine security agent,

00:01:04.220 --> 00:01:06.210
what were you doing the last four years?

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:09.090
I mean, famously the
Trumps did not have dogs.

00:01:09.090 --> 00:01:09.923
No, sir.

00:01:09.923 --> 00:01:12.370
They did not have a dog, but
they did have Eric Trump, sir,

00:01:12.370 --> 00:01:14.320
and I was assigned to him.

00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:16.750
All right, but Eric Trump is not a dog.

00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:18.730
Nobody said Eric Trump was a dog, okay.

00:01:18.730 --> 00:01:19.770
People like dogs.

00:01:19.770 --> 00:01:21.400
People want to be around dogs.

00:01:21.400 --> 00:01:23.060
Dogs can learn new things,

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:26.870
but we did feel that there was
enough psychological overlap

00:01:26.870 --> 00:01:29.900
between dogs and Eric that,
that I could work with him.

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:32.460
Okay, well what do you mean by that?

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:36.280
Well, Eric Trump is, he's energetic.

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:37.910
He's eager to please.

00:01:37.910 --> 00:01:39.825
He's spoiled as hell.

00:01:39.825 --> 00:01:42.250
I mean, I got to tell ya, and
he loves to chase a Frisbee

00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:45.410
and he is capable of being
a very, very good boy.

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:46.243
Oh, okay.

00:01:46.243 --> 00:01:49.110
So there are, I see that,
there's yeah, I see.

00:01:49.110 --> 00:01:50.740
Yeah, the first time I met him, he was

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:53.700
extremely suspicious of me,
but as soon as he got up there

00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:58.320
and sniffed my crotch, we, we
became friends and you know,

00:01:58.320 --> 00:02:00.500
soon thereafter he was
sleeping at the foot

00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:01.850
of my bed every night.

00:02:01.850 --> 00:02:04.740
I'm sorry, Eric slept
at the foot of your bed?

00:02:04.740 --> 00:02:05.573
Yes, sir.

00:02:05.573 --> 00:02:08.180
Oh, unless I had a lady spend the night.

00:02:08.180 --> 00:02:10.250
Then it was back in the crate.

00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:11.268
Ah, yeah.

00:02:11.268 --> 00:02:12.700
You got to, you can't
have him roaming around.

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:16.060
Actually, you know, I
couldn't ask for a nicer boy

00:02:16.060 --> 00:02:18.110
if I'm being honest with
you and I, and I brought

00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:21.080
some pictures I'd like to
show you if you'd like.

00:02:21.080 --> 00:02:22.250
[Conan] Yeah, let's see these photos.

00:02:22.250 --> 00:02:23.200
This is great.

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:26.260
Great, so this is a, this is Eric on the,

00:02:26.260 --> 00:02:28.770
on the first warm day of spring.

00:02:28.770 --> 00:02:31.380
[Conan] Actually got eight
nipples, that's odd, yeah.

00:02:31.380 --> 00:02:34.270
Yes sir, yes sir, and he
loved having his tummy rubbed.

00:02:34.270 --> 00:02:35.140
Ooh, we loved it.

00:02:35.140 --> 00:02:37.220
Here's another one I took
on the Fourth of July.

00:02:37.220 --> 00:02:38.740
[Conan] Ooh, he looks scared.

00:02:38.740 --> 00:02:41.510
The, the fireworks really freaked him out.

00:02:41.510 --> 00:02:43.090
It's actually, it's the only time

00:02:43.090 --> 00:02:45.230
I saw him express his anal glands.

00:02:45.230 --> 00:02:46.063
Yeah, okay.

00:02:46.063 --> 00:02:47.510
We don't need to hear everything.

00:02:47.510 --> 00:02:49.170
You could have skipped that part, okay.

00:02:49.170 --> 00:02:50.020
Yeah, yes, sir.

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:51.970
Okay, well here's a happier time.

00:02:51.970 --> 00:02:54.920
This is a photo of Eric with his family.

00:02:54.920 --> 00:02:57.170
[Conan] I'm sorry, is that
a plastic cone on his head?

00:02:57.170 --> 00:02:58.080
Yes, sir.

00:02:58.080 --> 00:03:02.290
He got ear mites after, after
playing with Steve Bannon

00:03:02.290 --> 00:03:05.480
and we tried to put a, a cream on his ear

00:03:05.480 --> 00:03:08.060
but he kept rubbing it off and yeah.

00:03:08.060 --> 00:03:11.530
Well, well anyway, Eric's
gone now and you have

00:03:11.530 --> 00:03:13.370
two real dogs to look after.

00:03:13.370 --> 00:03:14.623
How is it different now?

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:17.290
It's very different, sir.

00:03:17.290 --> 00:03:21.090
First, Champ and Major
never tried to hump my leg

00:03:21.090 --> 00:03:23.390
and you know, Eric was
always getting after it.

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:26.340
I had to use a squirt
gun to get him off me.

00:03:26.340 --> 00:03:27.780
Let me just check here.

00:03:27.780 --> 00:03:31.526
Yeah, yeah, both these guys
still have their testicles.

00:03:31.526 --> 00:03:33.970
Ah, very good, and scene.

00:03:33.970 --> 00:03:37.450
Special Agent James Duncan,
thank you for spending your time

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:39.150
and best of luck to you.

00:03:39.150 --> 00:03:39.983
Thank you, sir.

00:03:39.983 --> 00:03:41.240
Thank you for having me, Conan.

